 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi there! How's it going today?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_21",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm fine, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I have a language exchange partner, but we always end up speaking English.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "learning_language.ctx13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Happens a lot, especially if their English is stronger. Set a strict timer and split the hour, or look for a different partner?",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "learning_language.ctx13",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, Priya just called my name. Please wait and stay silent until I'm back.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.5,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instr_12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, I'll wait.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_05",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Grandpa, why do you always paint the sky before anything else?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.96,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Because everything else sits in front of it. Back to front, that's the old rule.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Even with the mountains?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Especially the mountains. Sky, then mountains, then the trees, then the little cottage.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I do the cottage this time?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.31,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "If you promise to keep the roof straight. Last time it looked like it was melting.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.63,
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It was a style choice!",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "block": "painting_art.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Anyway, where were we?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.33,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "implicit",
   "phrasing": "implicit_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure. So, what are you going to do about the English creep?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "learning_language.ctx13",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
